#: includes/class-admin.php:432
msgid ""
"Block matching URLs with an HTTP 414 response when their raw query string exceeds this many "
"bytes. Use 0 to disable. This applies only to URLs matching the patterns above and is checked "
"before accepting a CAPTCHA clearance."
