#: includes/class-admin.php:290
msgid ""
"Cloudflare is detected securely from its official proxy ranges. If Cloudflare Tunnel or another "
"trusted proxy hides the Cloudflare peer address, add that proxy CIDR with the "
"pow_captcha_trusted_proxy_ranges filter."
